      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "--> When working with the SDK, you'll define different phases \n   within the code :\n\n\n        ° A typical phase would be bringing in data from\n          an external source\n\n        ° Running some type of normalization or cleansing off\n          of that data, \n\n        and then \n\n        ° providing that data to the training functionality\n          that will be used to ultimately build the model",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> When working with the SDK, you'll define different phases \n   within the code :\n\n\n        ° A typical phase would be bringing in data from\n          an external source\n\n        ° Running some type of normalization or cleansing off\n          of that data, \n\n        and then \n\n        ° providing that data to the training functionality\n          that will be used to ultimately build the model",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": 1793614157791,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
