      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793710645510,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "--> Just like with Elyra, there'll be certain ways that you\n   can bring in data and export data that has been developed\n   and artifacts within the pipeline\n\n    ° This can be done through an S3 storage location,\n    or \n      it could be done with local storage defined within \n      a persistent volume claim",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> Just like with Elyra, there'll be certain ways that you\n   can bring in data and export data that has been developed\n   and artifacts within the pipeline\n\n    ° This can be done through an S3 storage location,\n    or \n      it could be done with local storage defined within \n      a persistent volume claim",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": 1793614276624,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
