      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "° Supports additional features :\n\n    - Artifact primitives to pass more complex \n      data between components, such as :\n        ° models, \n        ° data sets,\n      and \n        ° metrics \n\n    - Node selectors, taints, and toleration parameters\n\n    - Caching\n\n    - A CLI and local runners for testing",
