      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "--> Just like with Elyra, you can manage the pipeline from the OpenShift AI dashboard\n    There are a variety of different functionalities that are available through\n    the dashboard when managing these pipelines :\n\n        ° You can run the Pipeline\n\n        ° You can check on status\n and \n        ° check on the logs.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> Just like with Elyra, you can manage the pipeline from the OpenShift AI dashboard\n    There are a variety of different functionalities that are available through\n    the dashboard when managing these pipelines :\n\n        ° You can run the Pipeline\n\n        ° You can check on status\n and \n        ° check on the logs.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": 1793614562179,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
